// Windows resources of conjure_editor (docs/handbook/brand.md). GLFW gives every window of the process the icon
// named GLFW_ICON, and Explorer and the taskbar show the executable's first icon group, so this one entry covers
// both. conjure_editor.ico is generated by tools/generate_brand_icons.py from docs/assets/brand/icon.

GLFW_ICON ICON "conjure_editor.ico"
